<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Whom have I in heaven but Thee?</l><l>And there is none upon the earth</l><l>That I desire beside Thee.</l><l>My flesh and my heart faileth;</l><l>But God is the strength of my heart,</l><l>And my portion forever.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
